From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DWSR nix-config <noreply@local>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 12:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] cavemem: enforce Pi full row storage policy

Written for pi-agent-integration task 3.3 against Cavemem v0.2.1,
commit e934e436e0dcb68422475d85385f7f8eb5e449b1, after the repository's
pi-full-v1 payload patch.

Return uncompressed observations exactly as persisted on every expansion
path. Keep compressed observations on their existing expansion path.

Limit embedding writes, missing-row selection, and vector enumeration to
compressed observations. The worker port serializes startup and HTTP readiness
requires an atomically published matching `{pid,nonce,port}` receipt. Shutdown
compare-removes readiness while retaining the listener; restart signals only a
verified owner and waits for quiescence. CLI status and hook auto-start accept
only nonce-matched readiness, while any other bound listener retains the lease.
---
